 "segments": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 0.8,
   "text": "What would convince you?"
  },
  {
   "s": 0.84,
   "e": 4.08,
   "text": "What piece of evidence would make you go shut it down right now?"
  },
  {
   "s": 4.32,
   "e": 10.9,
   "text": "You know, if AI took over all of the Waymos in San Francisco and started telling them"
  },
  {
   "s": 10.9,
   "e": 15.72,
   "text": "to crash into people and we couldn't shut it down for a month."
  },
  {
   "s": 15.86,
   "e": 16.74,
   "text": "What if it's only a week?"
  },
  {
   "s": 17.08,
   "e": 17.48,
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "s": 17.6,
   "e": 19.16,
   "text": "Now we're just hanging, right?"
  },
  {
   "s": 19.18,
   "e": 21.52,
   "text": "But I'm trying to understand the absolute minimum where you would go."
  },
  {
   "s": 21.64,
   "e": 22.1,
   "text": "This is insane."
  },
  {
   "s": 22.26,
   "e": 23.82,
   "text": "To me, month or week makes no difference."
  },
  {
   "s": 24.18,
   "e": 26.82,
   "text": "If something like this happens, like, it's maybe too late."
  },
  {
   "s": 26.82,
   "e": 30.88,
   "text": "Okay, if a week or a month doesn't make any difference, let me continue with my answer."
  },
  {
   "s": 31.26,
   "e": 36.66,
   "text": "Then I would say, wow, this does feel like we've crossed some path where there's demonstrable"
  },
  {
   "s": 36.66,
   "e": 40.96,
   "text": "harm to human beings out there in the world, which has not yet been the case."
  }
